# Review: DevShellPlugin

Both operations are declared with the spec's keys, inputs and outputs, and their handlers forward to the
Vite harness route through `Shell`. The handlers are exercised end to end against a real harness host in
`operations.test.ts`, and the harness itself (timeouts, clipping, all-or-nothing edits, root scoping) has
thorough tests under `vite-plugin/`. QA-1's operation steps are what `operations.test.ts` runs, though
against a test host rather than Composer's dev server. QA-2 is walked only by an autocue demo flow; the
template's scaffold has a unit test. Of 4 items: 2 done, 0 untested, 2 partial, 0 diverged, 0 missing.

